{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The reproduced frame confirms three goal outlines and three movable rings/pieces: two selectable color-14 pieces and one large color-11 piece isolated in the upper-left chamber. The two color-13 objects cycle with period six on every arrow action. The preserved “best” path seats both small pieces but does not finish, so the dense progress metric must include transferring the large color-11 ring to the lower-left target. I’m now narrowing the contact/transfer mechanic rather than expanding another raw-frame search."}}
